\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Monthly satellite allocation weights by sector (MVS investor, 35\% sleeve, score improvement floor 0.001, February 2004 -- July 2026). Shaded bands mark the three crisis episodes. Bold frames highlight the three satellites that carry the allocation: XLE through the 2004--2012 commodity cycle and again from 2022, XLK from 2018 onward, and XAU concentrated in the 2004--2012 and 2020--2026 stress periods. The defensive sectors (XLP, XLU, XLV) are selected only rarely, which is consistent with the displacement rule funding defensive tilts from the equity leg rather than from the whole core.}}{5}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:satweights}{{3}{5}{Monthly satellite allocation weights by sector (MVS investor, 35\% sleeve, score improvement floor 0.001, February 2004 -- July 2026). Shaded bands mark the three crisis episodes. Bold frames highlight the three satellites that carry the allocation: XLE through the 2004--2012 commodity cycle and again from 2022, XLK from 2018 onward, and XAU concentrated in the 2004--2012 and 2020--2026 stress periods. The defensive sectors (XLP, XLU, XLV) are selected only rarely, which is consistent with the displacement rule funding defensive tilts from the equity leg rather than from the whole core}{figure.caption.3}{}}
